            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A cleaner head for a vacuum cleaner is provided. The cleaner head comprises an optical system located towards one side of the cleaner head, the optical system comprising a light source and beam shaping means for receiving light emitted from the light source and directing the light towards a work surface on which the cleaner head is disposed so as to illuminate debris upon a region of a planar work surface. Said region is in the shape of a sector having a central axis aligned at an angle in the range from 35° to 65° to a front edge of the cleaner head, and one of the radii bounding the sector aligned at an acute angle of less than 20° to the front edge of the cleaner head.</p>
            </abstract>
